Service Provider Registration
-------------------------------
name, contact,
a. Business details
b. State/city
c. Address
d. GST IN mo
e. Upload attachment -to validate the credentials, a service
provider may need to upload a few documents as an
attachment.
f. Description
g. Website URL
h. Company Logo
Select membership package -a list of membership packages created by the
administrator will appear. A service provider may select a membership
package and proceed to purchase the same. The system will redirect the
service provider to the payment gateway to make the payment. Once the
payment is successful, a certain “credit value” will be added to the service
provider account


Customer Sign up/Guest Sign up
-----------------------------------
1. Signup by providing the mobile no- the signup process will be a
simple one step process. A customer must provide email to confirm
the registration.
2. As an alternative method, a customer can sign up using FaceBook Account
Once the account is created, the user will receive the account activation OTP
via email .
Once the registration is successful, the system will generate unique User ID.
The generated User ID will be 8 characters long and will contain
alphanumeric code.



